        "description": {
          "text": "Revised Pediatric Use section based on pediatric study in type 2 diabetes patients ages 10 to <18 years",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "These Prior Approval sNDAs provide for revisions to section 8.4 *Pediatric Use* of the Onglyza and Kombiglyze XR Prescribing Information and Medication Guides based on the results of the pediatric study D1680C00019 (CV181375) entitled, A 26-week, *multicenter, randomized, placebo-controlled, double-blind, parallel group, phase 3 trial* with a 26-week safety extension period evaluating the safety and efficacy of *dapagliflozin 5 and 10 mg, and saxagliptin 2.5 and 5 mg in pediatric patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus who are between 10 and below 18 years of age*. Additional edits were made throughout the Prescribing Information and Medication Guides for Onglyza and Kombiglyze XR to modernize with current labeling guidances, clarify language, improve readability and organization of information, and align with other products.",
              "doc_id": "6a759453-a21d-5b95-b6f0-ad337fb7c802",
              "line": 5
            }
